# Fixed defect 2613, 2026-11-20, lane umbrella-2: a `use` of a package's
# private module under a `packages` line was told twice, `package_not_listed`
# first, its note offering `heroes add kit/csv/internal/scan`, a line that
# would list a private module, then `private_module`. A program's own module
# never names a private module of a package, so no line lists one: each such
# `use` is told once, as private, whether the module's owner is listed
# (`csv`) or not (`text`).
use <kit>/csv
use <kit>/csv/internal/scan  #~ private_module
use <kit>/text/internal/cut  #~ private_module

function main()
    print(csv.first("a,b"))
    print(scan.comma_at("a,b"))
    print(cut.half("abcd"))
